79	A seed-stratified $\chi^2$ test confirms the overall mode distribution differs significantly between ISR and random conditions ($\chi^2{=}174.8$, $\text{df}{=}2$, $p{<}10^{-38}$; Appendix~\ref{app:statistical-details}).
